{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/range/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Range","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use our custom range inputs for consistent cross-browser styling with a filled track, value bubble, and tick marks."},"blocks":[{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The native <code>&lt;input type=&quot;range&quot;&gt;</code> is hard to style and can’t show a filled track in a consistent, cross-browser way using CSS alone—only Firefox offers <code>::-moz-range-progress</code>, and CSS can’t read an input’s value. So our range is a small <strong>JavaScript component</strong>: wrap an <code>&lt;input class=&quot;form-range-input&quot;&gt;</code> in <code>.form-range</code> and the plugin keeps a <code>--bs-range-fill</code> custom property (0–1) in sync, which the CSS uses to draw the fill, the value bubble, and tick marks."},{"id":"overview--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>.form-range</code> wrapper owns the component’s tokens, so the input and any decorations inherit them. Every <code>.form-range</code> on the page is initialized automatically."},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"99debdd3f1d9da3b05ac","height":174,"anchors":["range1"]},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"range1\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" id=\"range1\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"theme-colors","type":"heading","en":"Theme colors","level":2},{"id":"theme-colors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modify the appearance of the range by adding the <code>.theme-{color}</code> class to the <code>.form-range</code> wrapper. This will set the track fill and thumb color to the theme color."},{"id":"theme-colors--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b63b0e46c7326bd68042","height":300},{"id":"theme-colors--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-range theme-primary\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example primary range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-accent\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example accent range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-success\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example success range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-danger\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example danger range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-warning\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example warning range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-info\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example info range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-inverse\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example inverse range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-secondary\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example secondary range\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"disabled","type":"heading","en":"Disabled","level":2},{"id":"disabled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>disabled</code> boolean attribute on the input to give it a grayed out appearance, remove pointer events, and prevent focusing."},{"id":"disabled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"df77140dbd6ecc3ef44f","height":174,"anchors":["disabledRange"]},{"id":"disabled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"disabledRange\" class=\"form-label\">Disabled range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" id=\"disabledRange\" disabled>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"min-and-max","type":"heading","en":"Min and max","level":2},{"id":"min-and-max--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Range inputs have implicit values for <code>min</code> and <code>max</code>—<code>0</code> and <code>100</code>, respectively. You may specify new values for those using the <code>min</code> and <code>max</code> attributes."},{"id":"min-and-max--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a0c633ff40e65406e1d2","height":174,"anchors":["range2"]},{"id":"min-and-max--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"range2\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" id=\"range2\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"steps","type":"heading","en":"Steps","level":2},{"id":"steps--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"By default, range inputs “snap” to integer values. To change this, you can specify a <code>step</code> value. In the example below, we double the number of steps by using <code>step=&quot;0.5&quot;</code>."},{"id":"steps--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2ec2535065d0e80b7694","height":174,"anchors":["range3"]},{"id":"steps--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"range3\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.5\" id=\"range3\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"value-bubble","type":"heading","en":"Value bubble","level":2},{"id":"value-bubble--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>data-bs-bubble</code> to the wrapper to show a value bubble that follows the thumb. The bubble reuses our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/components/tooltips/\">tooltip</a> styles."},{"id":"value-bubble--example-1","type":"demo","key":"26ae62d2cf4c2d00bfa7","height":174,"anchors":["rangeBubble"]},{"id":"value-bubble--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"rangeBubble\" class=\"form-label\">Brightness</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\" data-bs-bubble>\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\" id=\"rangeBubble\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"tick-marks","type":"heading","en":"Tick marks","level":2},{"id":"tick-marks--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Link a <code>&lt;datalist&gt;</code> to the input with the <code>list</code> attribute and the plugin renders a tick mark for each <code>&lt;option&gt;</code>, positioned at its value (even when the values are unevenly spaced). An <code>&lt;option&gt;</code>’s <code>label</code> is shown beneath its tick."},{"id":"tick-marks--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2a8fb9cf54f3e70c2ba9","height":201,"anchors":["rangeTicks","rangeTicksList"]},{"id":"tick-marks--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"rangeTicks\" class=\"form-label\">Temperature</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"25\" value=\"50\" list=\"rangeTicksList\" id=\"rangeTicks\">\n</div>\n<datalist id=\"rangeTicksList\">\n  <option value=\"0\" label=\"Cold\"></option>\n  <option value=\"25\"></option>\n  <option value=\"50\" label=\"Mild\"></option>\n  <option value=\"75\"></option>\n  <option value=\"100\" label=\"Hot\"></option>\n</datalist>","language":""},{"id":"with-form-field","type":"heading","en":"With form field","level":2},{"id":"with-form-field--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap the <code>.form-range</code> in a <code>.form-field</code> to pair it with a label and description."},{"id":"with-form-field--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e82fc6aecb3a3bbf8ec8","height":147,"anchors":["rangeField"]},{"id":"with-form-field--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <label for=\"rangeField\" class=\"form-label\">Volume</label>\n  <div class=\"form-range\" data-bs-bubble>\n    <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" id=\"rangeField\">\n  </div>\n  <small class=\"form-text\">Adjust the volume level.</small>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"usage","type":"heading","en":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"usage--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Every <code>.form-range</code> is initialized automatically on page load—the component is JavaScript-driven, so the fill won’t render without the plugin."},{"id":"via-data-attributes","type":"heading","en":"Via data attributes","level":3},{"id":"via-data-attributes--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Attribute"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>data-bs-bubble</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Add to the <code>.form-range</code> wrapper to show a <a href=\"#value-bubble\">value bubble</a>."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>list</code> (on the input) + <code>&lt;datalist&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Renders <a href=\"#tick-marks\">tick marks</a> from the datalist options."}]}]}]},{"id":"via-data-attributes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-range\" data-bs-bubble>\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"40\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"via-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Via JavaScript","level":3},{"id":"via-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"const element = document.querySelector('.form-range')\nconst range = new bootstrap.Range(element, {\n  bubble: true,\n  formatter: value => `${value}%`\n})","language":""},{"id":"dependencies","type":"heading","en":"Dependencies","level":3},{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The range plugin requires the following JavaScript files if you’re building Bootstrap’s JS from source:"},{"id":"dependencies--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"File"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/range.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Main range component"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/base-component.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Base component class"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/data.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Element data store"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/event-handler.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"Event handling utilities"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/manipulator.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"Data attribute manipulation"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/dom/selector-engine.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"DOM selector utilities"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/util/config.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"Configuration base class"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>js/src/util/index.ts</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"dependencies--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"Core utility functions"}]}]}]},{"id":"options","type":"heading","en":"Options","level":3},{"id":"options--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Name"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Default"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>bubble</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>false</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"Show a value bubble above the thumb."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>formatter</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"function"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>null</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>(value) =&gt; string</code> used for the bubble and tick label text."}]}]}]},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","en":"Methods","level":3},{"id":"methods--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Method"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>update()</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Recompute the fill from the input’s current value. Useful after setting the value programmatically."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>dispose()</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Destroys the instance and removes the bubble and tick marks it created."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>getInstance()</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"Static method to get the instance associated with a <code>.form-range</code> element."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>getOrCreateInstance()</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"methods--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"Static method to get the instance, or create one if it doesn’t exist."}]}]}]},{"id":"events","type":"heading","en":"Events","level":3},{"id":"events--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Event"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>changed.bs.range</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Fired on the input when the value updates (on <code>input</code> and <code>change</code>). The event’s <code>value</code> property holds the current numeric value."}]}]}]},{"id":"events--code-1","type":"code","value":"const input = document.querySelector('.form-range-input')\n\ninput.addEventListener('changed.bs.range', event => {\n  console.log('Value:', event.value)\n})","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Range use local CSS variables on <code>.form-range</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$range-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --range-track-width: 100%,\n    --range-track-height: .5rem,\n    --range-track-cursor: pointer,\n    --range-track-bg: var(--bg-3),\n    --range-track-border-radius: 1rem,\n    --range-track-fill-bg: var(--theme-bg, var(--primary-base)),\n    --range-track-disabled-bg: color-mix(in oklch, var(--bg-4), var(--fg-3)),\n    --range-thumb-width: 1rem,\n    --range-thumb-height: var(--range-thumb-width),\n    --range-thumb-bg: var(--theme-bg, var(--primary-base)),\n    --range-thumb-border: var(--range-thumb-bg) solid var(--border-color),\n    --range-thumb-border-radius: 1rem,\n    --range-thumb-box-shadow: \"0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 7.5%), 0 2px 4px rgb(0 0 0 / 7.5%)\",\n    --range-thumb-active-bg: color-mix(in oklch, var(--theme-bg, var(--primary-base)) 70%, var(--bg-body)),\n    --range-thumb-disabled-bg: var(--fg-3),\n    --range-thumb-transition-property: \"background-color, border-color, box-shadow\",\n    --range-thumb-transition-duration: .15s,\n    --range-thumb-transition-timing: ease-in-out,\n    --range-tick-width: var(--border-width),\n    --range-tick-height: .5rem,\n    --range-tick-bg: var(--border-color),\n  ),\n  $range-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"sass-mixins","type":"heading","en":"Sass mixins","level":3},{"id":"sass-mixins--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Two mixins generate the vendor-specific styles for the range’s track and thumb. Note that selectors for pseudo-elements in WebKit and Firefox cannot be combined—each must be used in a separate CSS rule otherwise the styles will not apply."},{"id":"sass-mixins--code-1","type":"code","value":"@mixin range-thumb() {\n  width: var(--range-thumb-width);\n  height: var(--range-thumb-height);\n  appearance: none;\n  @include gradient-bg(var(--range-thumb-bg));\n  border: var(--range-thumb-border);\n  @include border-radius(var(--range-thumb-border-radius));\n  @include box-shadow(var(--range-thumb-box-shadow));\n  @include transition-props(\n    var(--range-thumb-transition-property),\n    var(--range-thumb-transition-duration),\n    var(--range-thumb-transition-timing)\n  );\n\n  &:active {\n    @include gradient-bg(var(--range-thumb-active-bg));\n  }\n}\n\n@mixin range-track() {\n  width: var(--range-track-width);\n  height: var(--range-track-height);\n  color: transparent;\n  cursor: var(--range-track-cursor);\n  // Fill (progress) up to the thumb. The Range plugin keeps `--range-fill` (0–1) in sync.\n  background-color: var(--range-track-bg);\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(\n      to right,\n      var(--range-track-fill-bg) calc(var(--range-fill, 0) * 100%),\n      transparent calc(var(--range-fill, 0) * 100%)\n    );\n  border-color: transparent;\n  @include border-radius(var(--range-track-border-radius));\n  @include box-shadow(var(--range-track-box-shadow));\n}","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"99debdd3f1d9da3b05ac","html":"<label for=\"range1\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" id=\"range1\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b63b0e46c7326bd68042","html":"<div class=\"form-range theme-primary\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example primary range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-accent\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example accent range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-success\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example success range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-danger\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example danger range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-warning\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example warning range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-info\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example info range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-inverse\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example inverse range\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-range theme-secondary\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" aria-label=\"Example secondary range\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"df77140dbd6ecc3ef44f","html":"<label for=\"disabledRange\" class=\"form-label\">Disabled range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" id=\"disabledRange\" disabled=\"\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a0c633ff40e65406e1d2","html":"<label for=\"range2\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" id=\"range2\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2ec2535065d0e80b7694","html":"<label for=\"range3\" class=\"form-label\">Example range</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.5\" id=\"range3\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"26ae62d2cf4c2d00bfa7","html":"<label for=\"rangeBubble\" class=\"form-label\">Brightness</label>\n<div class=\"form-range\" data-bs-bubble=\"\">\n  <input type=\"range\" class=\"form-range-input\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\" id=\"rangeBubble\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2a8fb9cf54f3e70c2ba9","html":"<label for=\"rangeTicks\" cla